flowchart LR
  CLI[Examiner CLI] --> Gateway[FastMCP Gateway]
  Gateway --> Mode[Mode detect: cloud / airgap / dual]
  Mode --> Planner[Planner Protocol]
  Planner --> Critique[planner_critique]
  Critique --> Gate[comprehension_gate]
  Gate --> Fanout[executor_fanout]
  Fanout --> Deny[DenyRuleWrapper]
  Deny --> Tool[ToolExecutor in Microsandbox]
  Evidence[(Evidence vault: read-only + hashes)] --> Tool
  Tool --> Ledger[LedgerEmitter: HMAC JSONL]
  Ledger --> Quorum[quorum_node]
  Quorum --> Pivot[pivot_node]
  Quorum --> Replan[replan_node]
  Replan --> Planner
  Quorum --> Findings[Findings and exports]
  Ledger --> Langfuse[Langfuse trace tree]
  Quorum --> Checkpoint[SqliteSaver checkpoints]

